        <h2 class="fw-bold mb-3">One Unified Platform. Zero Siloed Point Solutions.</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mb-3" style="line-height: 1.7;">
          For decades, medical laboratories have suffered from fragmented legacy technology: one system for chemistry, a separate server for pathology, third-party software for billing, and manual spreadsheets for molecular and genetic testing.
        </p>
        <p class="text-muted mb-4" style="line-height: 1.7;">
          LISDESK changes that. We engineered a single high-throughput clinical operating platform that natively links sample accessioning, instrument bidirectional query, auto-verification, genomic variant curation, and insurance claim generation without middleware bloat.
        </p>
        <div class="d-flex gap-4">
          <div>
            <div class="fw-bold fs-3 text-primary">99.99%</div>
            <div class="small text-muted">Cloud Uptime SLA</div>
          </div>
          <div class="border-end"></div>
          <div>
            <div class="fw-bold fs-3 text-teal" style="color: var(--secondary);">40M+</div>
            <div class="small text-muted">Annual Specimens</div>
          </div>
          <div class="border-end"></div>
          <div>
            <div class="fw-bold fs-3 text-dark">700+</div>
            <div class="small text-muted">Analyzers Connected</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

