            <div class="brand-icon-box flex-shrink-0" style="width: 38px; height: 38px; font-size: 1rem;">1</div>
            <div>
              <div class="fw-bold text-dark">Zero Double-Keying</div>
              <div class="small text-muted">Direct bidirectional ASTM/HL7 analyzer drivers mean medical technologists never transcribe results by hand.</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="d-flex gap-3 mb-3">
            <div class="brand-icon-box flex-shrink-0" style="width: 38px; height: 38px; font-size: 1rem; background: var(--secondary);">2</div>
