              <div class="small text-muted">Every transaction is recorded in an immutable cryptographic audit log meeting CAP, CLIA, ISO 15189, and FDA 21 CFR Part 11.</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="d-flex gap-3">
            <div class="brand-icon-box flex-shrink-0" style="width: 38px; height: 38px; font-size: 1rem; background: #172033;">3</div>
